OL,3,GNEWSAPolice seize 1,100 illegal e-bikes
OL,4,Aand e-scooters
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 1,100 illegal e-bikes and
OL,7,Fe-scooters have been seized by a police
OL,8,Fforce in 12 months.
OL,10,FRecent figures show Lancashire Police
OL,11,Fseized 415 illegal e-bikes during
OL,12,F2025/26, the fourth-highest total
OL,13,Frecorded by any force in England.
OL,15,FNew laws regulating e-bikes and
OL,16,Fe-scooters could be introduced by the
OL,17,Fgovernment amid growing concerns over
OL,18,Ftheir misuse.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
