OL,3,GNEWSAPolice seize 1,100 illegal e-bikes
OL,4,Aand e-scooters
OL,5,
OL,6,FLancashire Police said some of the
OL,7,Fvehicles were ridden at high speeds
OL,8,Fthrough residential areas, on footpaths
OL,9,Fand in parks, and were frequently
OL,10,Flinked to wider anti-social behaviour
OL,11,Fand criminality.
